WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.900 --> 00:00:01.167
- This is our day.

00:00:01.167 --> 00:00:01.434
- This is our day.

00:00:01.434 --> 00:00:01.668
- This is our day.

00:00:01.668 --> 00:00:02.168
- This is our day.

00:00:02.168 --> 00:00:03.303
- [Tom Brady:] This is what we do it for
right here.

00:00:03.303 --> 00:00:05.171
- [Travis Kelce:] Hey! No moment's
ever too big for us!

00:00:05.171 --> 00:00:06.940
- Go, Pack, go!

00:00:06.940 --> 00:00:08.475
- [Announcer:]
Hardman fumbles the ball.

00:00:08.475 --> 00:00:09.609
It's recovered by Buffalo.

00:00:09.609 --> 00:00:11.411
- Look at me. Hey, look at me.
Hey, we're good.

00:00:11.411 --> 00:00:13.980
Just be you. You're gonna
make a play this game.

00:00:13.980 --> 00:00:15.749
- [Fan:] Floats it up and over!

00:00:15.749 --> 00:00:17.484
- Y'all seeing football
at its greatest right now.

00:00:17.484 --> 00:00:18.952
- We still ain't played our best yet.
- Nope.

00:00:18.952 --> 00:00:20.520
- Welcome
to the playoffs, baby.

00:00:20.520 --> 00:00:21.988
- Hey, these games
ain't for everybody!

00:00:21.988 --> 00:00:23.023
These games for the elite!

00:00:23.023 --> 00:00:24.324
- Just give all you got!

00:00:24.324 --> 00:00:25.925
- [Devin White:] Championship Sunday, man!

00:00:25.925 --> 00:00:27.460
- Yes.
- Championship Sunday.

00:00:27.460 --> 00:00:30.997
- Where else would you rather be
right now? Look at this.

00:00:30.997 --> 00:00:32.932
- [Joe Buck:]
It just doesn't get any better

00:00:32.932 --> 00:00:34.334
than what we're about to see.

00:00:34.334 --> 00:00:37.337
We can't wait for this game
to unfold in front of our eyes.

00:00:37.337 --> 00:00:38.872
We know you feel the same way.

00:00:38.872 --> 00:00:41.841
- ♪♪♪ There once was
a football team that played ♪♪♪

00:00:41.841 --> 00:00:44.310
♪♪♪ At Lambeau Field
in ol' Green Bay ♪♪♪

00:00:44.310 --> 00:00:46.679
- ♪♪♪ Soon may
the Buccaneers come ♪♪♪

00:00:46.679 --> 00:00:49.149
♪♪♪ To challenge Rodgers,
Jones and Adams ♪♪♪

00:00:49.149 --> 00:00:51.184
- ♪♪♪ Go, you Packers, go ♪♪♪
- ♪♪♪ Go, boys, Tampa Bay, go ♪♪♪

00:00:51.184 --> 00:00:52.786
- [Carlton Davis:] This time last year,

00:00:52.786 --> 00:00:55.321
we was considered
the worst team in the NFL!

00:00:55.321 --> 00:00:56.289
But look where we at now!

00:00:56.289 --> 00:00:58.458
- [Za’Darius Smith:] You gonna watch out
for them holding calls, right?

00:00:58.458 --> 00:00:59.893
- Snowing up in England.

00:00:59.893 --> 00:01:02.328
Great day for some
NFC Championship Game.

00:01:02.328 --> 00:01:03.129
Go, Pack, go!

00:01:03.129 --> 00:01:04.831
- Let's go, Bucs!

00:01:04.998 --> 00:01:05.999
- We know we wanna go!

00:01:05.999 --> 00:01:07.867
We wanna go play at home
next week!

00:01:07.867 --> 00:01:08.968
We gotta take care of today!

00:01:08.968 --> 00:01:12.372
- If I make this, the Packers
are going to the Super Bowl.

00:01:12.372 --> 00:01:14.074
♪♪♪

00:01:14.074 --> 00:01:16.042
Whoo!

00:01:16.042 --> 00:01:18.478
- [Micah Hyde:] Oohwee!

00:01:18.478 --> 00:01:20.580
AFC Championship Game!

00:01:20.580 --> 00:01:21.848
Let's go, let's go!

00:01:21.848 --> 00:01:23.650
The whole world watchin'.

00:01:23.650 --> 00:01:24.551
- [Fan:] Go Bills.

00:01:24.551 --> 00:01:27.821
- [Jim Nantz:]
The AFC Championship Game.

00:01:27.821 --> 00:01:29.389
The top two seeds:

00:01:29.389 --> 00:01:32.692
the Buffalo Bills
and the Kansas City Chiefs.

00:01:32.692 --> 00:01:33.827
- [Frank Clark:] Yeahhh!

00:01:33.827 --> 00:01:36.763
- [Fan:] You know what time
it is, Chiefs Kingdom.

00:01:37.097 --> 00:01:38.531
- We know what we made of.

00:01:38.531 --> 00:01:42.235
- Here we go, Bills Mafia!
AFC Championship!

00:01:42.235 --> 00:01:44.504
- [Josh Allen:] Yeah!
- [Cheering]

00:01:44.504 --> 00:01:47.240
- Keep that camera on me, dawg.
All game.

00:01:47.240 --> 00:01:49.442
- [Fan:] Let's go!

00:01:49.442 --> 00:01:50.844
- This what I work for!

00:01:50.844 --> 00:01:52.579
This what I work for,
right here!

00:01:52.579 --> 00:01:55.515
- AFC Championship, man.
Back to back to back!

00:01:55.515 --> 00:01:56.116
Stay tuned!

00:01:56.116 --> 00:02:00.854
[Crowd cheering]

00:02:00.854 --> 00:02:01.788
- [Announcer:]
Brady has all kinds of time.

00:02:01.788 --> 00:02:03.790
Throws toward the end zone.
It is a caught ball!

00:02:03.790 --> 00:02:06.059
Touchdown, Tampa Bay!
Mike Evans!

00:02:06.059 --> 00:02:07.927
- [Fan:] Floats it up and over!

00:02:07.927 --> 00:02:09.696
Bucs strike first!

00:02:09.696 --> 00:02:11.598
- [Evans:] Tom threw
a perfect ball, bro.

00:02:11.598 --> 00:02:14.067
Wow. Cuz that went right over him.

00:02:14.067 --> 00:02:15.802
- [Lavonte David:] Playoff litty! Playoff litty!

00:02:15.802 --> 00:02:17.704
- [Fan:]
Hit the spin "B" button.

00:02:17.704 --> 00:02:20.140
- [Buck:]
The spin and...touchdown!

00:02:20.140 --> 00:02:21.975
- Touchdown! Baby, let's go!

00:02:21.975 --> 00:02:24.477
- Way to go. Nice job.
That turned into zone on that.

00:02:24.477 --> 00:02:25.778
- Yeah.
- Way to see it.

00:02:25.778 --> 00:02:27.747
- [Announcer:] Hardman
standing at his 11-yard line.

00:02:27.747 --> 00:02:32.318
Drops it! Muffs it!
Bills' ball on the 3-yard line.

00:02:32.318 --> 00:02:35.221
- Let's go, baby!
- [Fan:] Dawson Knox, Dawson Knox, Dawson Knox.

00:02:35.221 --> 00:02:37.390
- [Nantz:] To Knox.
To the end zone.

00:02:37.390 --> 00:02:39.726
- Whoo! Yes!
- [Nantz:] Buffalo touchdown.

00:02:39.726 --> 00:02:42.162
- Mecole! Come on.
- Hey, hey, hey, hey.

00:02:42.162 --> 00:02:44.397
Look at me. Hey, look at me.
Hey, we're good.

00:02:44.397 --> 00:02:46.766
Just be you. You're gonna
make a play this game.

00:02:46.766 --> 00:02:49.402
- [Announcer:] Hardman
on a wide receiver screen.

00:02:49.402 --> 00:02:51.938
Into the end zone! Touchdown!

00:02:51.938 --> 00:02:54.007
- [Announcer:] Helping us to
forget about that muffed punt.

00:02:54.007 --> 00:02:57.076
- Hey! Hey!
That's how you handle adversity!

00:02:57.076 --> 00:02:59.646
Let's go. We're rolling.
One at a time!

00:02:59.646 --> 00:03:00.947
Do it again!

00:03:00.947 --> 00:03:03.983
- Next play!
Your next play your best play!

00:03:03.983 --> 00:03:07.187
- [Byron Leftwich:] We just gotta be ready
to attack outside, one-on-one.

00:03:08.154 --> 00:03:10.657
- [Buck:]
Brady goes for the deep shot!

00:03:10.657 --> 00:03:14.627
He's got a touchdown!
Scotty Miller!

00:03:14.627 --> 00:03:16.429
- Hey!
- You already know!

00:03:16.429 --> 00:03:18.264
You already know!
- Hey. Hey.

00:03:18.264 --> 00:03:20.200
- Scotty Miller time, baby.
Let's go.

00:03:20.200 --> 00:03:21.467
- Brady's masterful.

00:03:21.868 --> 00:03:23.102
- That’s them big nuts.

00:03:23.102 --> 00:03:24.671
- All day.
You know I got those, baby.

00:03:24.671 --> 00:03:25.371
- Whoo!

00:03:25.371 --> 00:03:26.639
- [Matt LaFleur:] Well, we're gonna find out

00:03:26.639 --> 00:03:28.641
a lot about ourselves
right here.

00:03:28.975 --> 00:03:31.611
- [Andy Reid:] This drive. This drive.

00:03:31.611 --> 00:03:33.980
- [Kelce:] Just cuz we got that lead
don't mean we can't get more.

00:03:34.681 --> 00:03:36.783
- [Nantz:] Here's Mahomes.
Look at—underhanded.

00:03:36.783 --> 00:03:38.618
He throws it for the touchdown!

00:03:40.720 --> 00:03:41.988
- [Kelce:] Ahh!

00:03:42.522 --> 00:03:44.857
Hell yeah!
Way to trust it, baby!

00:03:46.159 --> 00:03:47.727
- Yo, so I told y'all
Aaron Rodgers

00:03:47.727 --> 00:03:48.995
was gonna have to
put his cape on.

00:03:48.995 --> 00:03:51.731
- [LaFleur:] Let's go! Believe it!

00:03:51.731 --> 00:03:54.834
- Aaron Rodgers,
put the team on your back!

00:03:54.834 --> 00:03:56.336
- [Buck:] Slings it.
- Yeah!

00:03:56.336 --> 00:03:58.905
- [Buck:] Touchdown, Tonyan.

00:03:58.905 --> 00:04:00.473
- [LaFleur:] Nice job. Hell of a job, man.

00:04:00.473 --> 00:04:03.910
- [Davante Adams:] You had to have that.
You had to. I could tell.

00:04:03.910 --> 00:04:06.079
- [Announcer:] Blitz is on.
Throw, right side.

00:04:06.079 --> 00:04:08.414
- [Fan:] Let's go, baby!

00:04:08.414 --> 00:04:09.349
- [Announcer:] Touchdown!

00:04:09.349 --> 00:04:12.819
- It ain't over yet!
Let's goooo!

00:04:12.819 --> 00:04:14.887
- Hey, we gotta
get a stop right here.

00:04:14.887 --> 00:04:16.923
- We should have
a field day today.

00:04:16.923 --> 00:04:19.025
He's trying
to throw y'all a pick.

00:04:19.025 --> 00:04:20.526
- [Announcer:]
Brady under center.

00:04:20.526 --> 00:04:23.263
He pop flies,
and it is intercepted again!

00:04:23.263 --> 00:04:26.065
- [Fan:] Packers starting to
feel like a team of destiny!

00:04:26.065 --> 00:04:28.101
- [Troy Aikman:]
Tom Brady knows that his night

00:04:28.101 --> 00:04:29.769
is far from being over.

00:04:29.769 --> 00:04:32.705
- It took eight years
just to get back to here, dawg!

00:04:32.705 --> 00:04:33.172
Let's finish!

00:04:33.172 --> 00:04:34.707
- [Announcer:]
7:41 to go in the game.

00:04:34.707 --> 00:04:36.676
- Third down and goal.
- [Fan:] Chiefs, boys.

00:04:36.676 --> 00:04:39.379
- [Nantz:]
Lobs it up in the air to Kelce.

00:04:39.379 --> 00:04:41.681
- [Fan:] Touchdown, Chiefs!

00:04:41.681 --> 00:04:43.283
- [Announcer:]
The Bills' season is over.

00:04:43.283 --> 00:04:48.521
- This is the proudest I've been
of this team in almost 30 years.

00:04:48.521 --> 00:04:51.357
- Hey, way to ball, man.
First of many. First of many.

00:04:51.357 --> 00:04:52.392
For sure.
- Good luck.

00:04:52.392 --> 00:04:55.028
- For the city, I go crazy, man.
This is what I do, man!

00:04:55.028 --> 00:04:56.863
- We goin’ again, baby!

00:04:56.863 --> 00:05:00.366
- Back-to-back AFC champs!
Goin’ to the Super Bowl again!

00:05:00.366 --> 00:05:02.235
- How 'bout those...

00:05:02.235 --> 00:05:04.437
- [Together:] Chiefs!

00:05:04.437 --> 00:05:06.639
- [Announcer:] Can the Packers
get a score here

00:05:06.639 --> 00:05:09.976
and a two-point conversion
to get this thing tied?

00:05:11.210 --> 00:05:13.880
With time initially.
Steps up, scrambles.

00:05:13.880 --> 00:05:16.082
Throws late over the middle.
Incomplete.

00:05:16.082 --> 00:05:19.619
My goodness.
Aaron could have-—[sighing]

00:05:19.619 --> 00:05:20.553
- [LaFleur:] Oh. Kick it. Kick it.

00:05:20.553 --> 00:05:22.789
- [Announcer:] Wow. You would’ve
liked to have seen them

00:05:22.789 --> 00:05:23.656
get it done there.

00:05:23.656 --> 00:05:25.091
- [LaFleur:] Hey, we got three timeouts.

00:05:25.091 --> 00:05:25.958
- [Announcer:]
I'm a little surprised

00:05:25.958 --> 00:05:28.428
they didn't actually go for it
on fourth down there.

00:05:28.428 --> 00:05:29.929
- What?
- They're kicking a field goal.

00:05:29.929 --> 00:05:30.830
- Why?
- [Aikman:] I thought

00:05:30.830 --> 00:05:33.900
that they would go for it
on fourth down.

00:05:33.900 --> 00:05:36.903
- [Fan:] Me too, Troy. Me too.

00:05:36.903 --> 00:05:39.972
- You want me to illustrate
why that's so dumb or—

00:05:39.972 --> 00:05:40.807
now or later?

00:05:40.807 --> 00:05:41.674
- Let's go. This is it.

00:05:41.674 --> 00:05:42.842
- [Chris Godwin:] This is the one.
- This gotta be it.

00:05:42.842 --> 00:05:44.844
- [Aikman:] Who else would you
rather have than Tom Brady,

00:05:44.844 --> 00:05:46.245
the greatest to ever do it?

00:05:46.245 --> 00:05:49.515
- [Buck:] Third down and five
with 48 seconds left.

00:05:50.183 --> 00:05:51.184
- [Fan:] Yes!

00:05:51.184 --> 00:05:53.519
- [Buck:] Toss to Godwin.
- Yes!

00:05:53.519 --> 00:05:56.856
- [Buck:] He's got the first
down, and this game's over.

00:05:56.856 --> 00:05:59.759
- I waited so long for this.

00:05:59.759 --> 00:06:02.695
- We're goin’ to the Super Bowl!
- [Evans:] Let's go!

00:06:02.695 --> 00:06:03.963
- We comin' home!

00:06:03.963 --> 00:06:06.165
- [Brady:] Great playing, bro.
- Good job, Tommy.

00:06:06.165 --> 00:06:07.800
- [Brady:] You had a great season.
- Super Bowl-bound, baby!

00:06:07.800 --> 00:06:10.937
- We made it.
History made, baby!

00:06:10.937 --> 00:06:11.838
We in there, baby!

00:06:11.838 --> 00:06:15.475
- Big bro, man. Love you, man.
Let's go. One more. We at home.

00:06:15.475 --> 00:06:16.943
- I know. I know.
- We're at home!

00:06:16.943 --> 00:06:19.679
- I really look up to you,
too, man. Man, keep your head up.

00:06:19.679 --> 00:06:22.682
- Let’s go to the Super Bowl, baby.
- Let's go.

00:06:22.682 --> 00:06:23.549
- [Brady:] How ‘bout it, brother?

00:06:23.549 --> 00:06:24.550
- You've only done this
10 times.

00:06:24.550 --> 00:06:25.718
- Well, it's a little different
this year.

00:06:25.718 --> 00:06:27.787
- Yeah. I'd say so.
- A lil’ different.

00:06:27.854 --> 00:06:29.355
- I got somethin’ real special

00:06:29.355 --> 00:06:31.524
for my Green Bay Packer fans.
Hold on.

00:06:31.524 --> 00:06:34.060
- ♪♪♪ The crew sailed up
to Lambeau Field ♪♪♪

00:06:34.060 --> 00:06:36.362
♪♪♪ The Super Bowl's
on our own home field ♪♪♪

00:06:36.362 --> 00:06:38.498
♪♪♪ We'd be the first one
of our kind ♪♪♪

00:06:38.498 --> 00:06:41.634
♪♪♪ We'll take our rings
and go ♪♪♪

00:06:41.634 --> 00:06:43.669
- Fresh out the smoker.

00:06:43.669 --> 00:06:45.371
- [Fan:] Whoo!
- A hot "L."

00:06:45.371 --> 00:06:46.739
- [Fan:] A fresh, hot "L."

00:06:46.739 --> 00:06:48.674
- We goin’
to the Super Bowl, baby!

